# Orchestration

- Large tasks: `virtual-company-swarm` → `subagent-orchestrator`. Label `[Agent: role]` before a slice.
- Parallel only with no shared writes. One file → one writer per wave.
- Log dispatches in `.agent-journal/` (`agent-action-journal`). Status board: `.agent_status.md`.
- Parent verifies; do not trust subagent LGTM alone.
- Tiny 1-file edits: do them yourself (no Task).
- Do not co-load bodies of `agent-orchestrator` + `multi-agent-task-orchestrator` + `parallel-agents`.
